{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-herefordshire-council-february-2025","content_id":"ed940e82-5e91-4392-9e48-62052b7c5353","description":"Statutory direction issued to Herefordshire Council in relation to children's services.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"67a38a1d567402152f553ca6","filename":"Revised_statutory_direction_Herefordshire_council_Feb_2025.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":99538,"filename":"Revised_statutory_direction_Herefordshire_council_Feb_2025.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9400180","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"Revised direction issued to Herefordshire Council: February 2025","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/67a38a1d567402152f553ca6/Revised_statutory_direction_Herefordshire_council_Feb_2025.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>This statutory direction was revoked on 13 July 2026 following a <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/884\">report by Ofsted</a> that judged the overall effectiveness of the council’s children’s services to be good and a <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/herefordshire-childrens-services-commissioner-report\">final report</a> by the children’s services commissioner.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>This direction requires the council to continue to co-operate with the commissioner appointed by the Secretary of State for Education.</p>\n\n<p>It follows:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>an <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/884\">Ofsted inspection report</a> of Herefordshire Council local authority children’s services published 21 September 2022 that judged services to be inadequate across all sub judgements</li>\n  <li>\n<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/herefordshire-childrens-services-commissioner-report\">independent reports</a> from the Secretary of State’s Commissioner for Herefordshire Children Services</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This direction replaces the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-herefordshire-council-march-2023\">Revised direction issued to Herefordshire Council</a> in March 2023.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"This direction was revoked on 13 July 2026.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-17T11:00:02Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-02-07T00:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"featured_attachments":["9400180"],"first_public_at":"2025-02-07T00:00:00.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2025-02-07T00:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-herefordshire-council-february-2025","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-herefordshire-council-february-2025","base_path":"/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-herefordshire-council-february-2025","content_id":"ed940e82-5e91-4392-9e48-62052b7c5353","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-17T11:00:02Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Revised direction issued to Herefordshire Council: February 2025","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publicatio